# Get a free key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Either the v3 API key or the v4 "API Read Access Token" works.
# Optional: browsing and importing both work without it, using bundled sample
# data and title-only matching, but a real key gets you live data and artwork.
TMDB_API_KEY=

# Optional. A Postgres connection string, e.g. from Neon, Supabase or RDS.
# If unset, the app uses an embedded Postgres (PGlite) that stores data as a
# file under .data/pglite - fine for local dev, not for serverless hosts whose
# filesystem doesn't persist between requests.
DATABASE_URL=
